{"strongs": "H0047", "word": "אַבִּיר", "translit": "ab.bir", "root": "אבר", "morph": "H:A-M", "pos": "adjective", "gloss": "mighty, valiant", "definition": "אַבִּיר adjective mighty, valiant — ׳ א Job 34:20 + Isa 10:13 Kt ( Qr כַּבִּיר ); construct id. 1Sam 21:8 plural אַכִּירִים Job 24:22 +; — mighty (always = substantive & in poetry except 1Sam 21:8 ). 1. men Job 24:22 (= violent ) Job 34:20 ; 1Sam 21:8 (read הָרָצִים ׳ א Gr Dr , compare 1Sam 22:17 but Lag Probebibel אֹבִיל הָעֲיָרִים see Id. BN 45 ; Klo גִּבּוֺר ), Lam 1:15 אַבִּירֵי לֵב stout of heart Isa 46:12 (= obstinate ) Ps 76:6 . 2. angels Ps 78:25 (compare Ps 103:20 ). 3. animals; bull, simile of king of Assyrian Isa 10:13 (read כְּאַבִּיר & see Di ); elsewhere plural; metaphor for enemies אַבִּירֵי בָשָׁן ) Ps 22:13 (|| פּרים ); for princes Ps 68:31 for Edomites Isa 34:7 hence even as sacrificial Ps 50:13 (|| עַתּוּדִים ); of horses Jer 8:16 ; Jer 47:3 ; Jer 50:11 . ** Judg 5:22 ; Jer 46:15 (but Jer 46:15 many MSS. ᵐ5 Aq Symm Theod ᵑ9 many moderns read אַבִּירֶ֑ךָ thy bull , i.e. Apis). אַבְרָהָם see אַבְרָם below II. אבה .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB76')\">BDB76</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H47')\">H47</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB75')\">BDB75</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB77')\">BDB77</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אַבִּיר</bdbheb> <b>adjective</b> <highlightword>mighty, valiant</highlightword> — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 34:20\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(18,34,20)\">Job 34:20</ref> + <ref ref=\"Isa 10:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,13)\">Isa 10:13</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>כַּבִּיר</bdbheb>); construct <highlight>id.</highlight> <ref ref=\"1Sam 21:8\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(9,21,8)\">1Sam 21:8</ref> plural <bdbheb>אַכִּירִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 24:22\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(18,24,22)\">Job 24:22</ref> +; — <highlight>mighty</highlight> (always = substantive &amp; in poetry except <ref ref=\"1Sam 21:8\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(9,21,8)\">1Sam 21:8</ref>). <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> men <ref ref=\"Job 24:22\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(18,24,22)\">Job 24:22</ref> (= <highlight>violent</highlight>) <ref ref=\"Job 34:20\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(18,34,20)\">Job 34:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 21:8\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(9,21,8)\">1Sam 21:8</ref> (read <bdbheb>הָרָצִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gr')\">Gr</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>, compare <ref ref=\"1Sam 22:17\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(9,22,17)\">1Sam 22:17</ref> but <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup>Probebibel</sup></lookup> <bdbheb>אֹבִיל הָעֲיָרִים</bdbheb> see <highlight>Id.</highlight><sup>BN 45</sup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Klo')\">Klo</lookup> <bdbheb>גִּבּוֺר</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Lam 1:15\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(25,1,15)\">Lam 1:15</ref> <bdbheb>אַבִּירֵי לֵב</bdbheb> <highlight>stout of heart</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 46:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,46,12)\">Isa 46:12</ref> (= <highlight>obstinate</highlight>) <ref ref=\"Ps 76:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"76\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"76\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,76,6)\">Ps 76:6</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> angels <ref ref=\"Ps 78:25\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,25)\">Ps 78:25</ref> (compare <ref ref=\"Ps 103:20\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"103\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"103\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(19,103,20)\">Ps 103:20</ref>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> animals; bull, simile of king of Assyrian <ref ref=\"Isa 10:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,13)\">Isa 10:13</ref> (read <bdbheb>כְּאַבִּיר</bdbheb> &amp; see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup>); elsewhere plural; metaphor for enemies <bdbheb>אַבִּירֵי בָשָׁן</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Ps 22:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,22,13)\">Ps 22:13</ref> (|| <bdbheb>פּרים</bdbheb>); for princes <ref ref=\"Ps 68:31\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"68\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"68\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(19,68,31)\">Ps 68:31</ref> for Edomites <ref ref=\"Isa 34:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,34,7)\">Isa 34:7</ref> hence even as sacrificial <ref ref=\"Ps 50:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,50,13)\">Ps 50:13</ref> (|| <bdbheb>עַתּוּדִים</bdbheb>); of horses <ref ref=\"Jer 8:16\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(24,8,16)\">Jer 8:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 47:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,47,3)\">Jer 47:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 50:11\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,11)\">Jer 50:11</ref>. </div><div class=\"remarks\"><b>**</b><ref ref=\"Judg 5:22\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,22)\">Judg 5:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 46:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,46,15)\">Jer 46:15</ref> (but <ref ref=\"Jer 46:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,46,15)\">Jer 46:15</ref> many MSS. <bdbheb>ᵐ5</bdbheb> Aq Symm Theod <bdbheb>ᵑ9</bdbheb> many moderns read <bdbheb>אַבִּירֶ֑ךָ</bdbheb> <highlight>thy bull</highlight>, i.e. Apis). </p></div><hr><p><bdbheb>אַבְרָהָם</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>אַבְרָם</reflink></bdbheb> below II. <bdbheb>אבה</bdbheb>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Job 34:20", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 34, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Isa 10:13", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 10, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "1Sam 21:8", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 21, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Job 24:22", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 24, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "1Sam 22:17", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 22, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Lam 1:15", "book": "LAM", "chapter": 1, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Isa 46:12", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 46, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Ps 76:6", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 76, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Ps 78:25", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 78, "verse": 25}, {"raw": "Ps 103:20", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 103, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Ps 22:13", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 22, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Ps 68:31", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 68, "verse": 31}, {"raw": "Isa 34:7", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 34, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Ps 50:13", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 50, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Jer 8:16", "book": "JER", "chapter": 8, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Jer 47:3", "book": "JER", "chapter": 47, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Jer 50:11", "book": "JER", "chapter": 50, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Judg 5:22", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 5, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Jer 46:15", "book": "JER", "chapter": 46, "verse": 15}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["אַבִּיר", "׳", "א", "כַּבִּיר", "אַכִּירִים", "הָרָצִים", "אֹבִיל הָעֲיָרִים", "גִּבּוֺר", "אַבִּירֵי לֵב", "כְּאַבִּיר", "אַבִּירֵי בָשָׁן", "פּרים", "עַתּוּדִים", "ᵐ5", "ᵑ9", "אַבִּירֶ֑ךָ", "אַבְרָהָם", "אַבְרָם", "אבה"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["Di", "Dr", "Gr", "Klo", "Kt", "Lag", "Qr"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB76", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}